---
// Converted from the demo page src/pages/pricing/index.html — content unchanged.
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Navigation from '../../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Dialogs from '../../components/Dialogs.astro';
import Seo from '../../components/Seo.astro';
import { css, js } from '../../lib/site';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">
<title>Pricing — Favorite Hearts</title>
<meta name="description" content="Pricing at Favorite Hearts. Clear information for thoughtful matrimony introductions and support.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("landing.css")}>
<script is:inline src={js("site-config.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("site.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("resource-carousel.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("resources.js")} defer>
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("monochrome.css")}>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("resources.css")}>
<script is:inline src={js("pricing-carousel.js")} defer>
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("welcome.css")}>
<script is:inline src={js("welcome.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("motion.js")} defer></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("design-system.css")}>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("tailwind.css")}>
<Seo route="/pricing/" title={"Pricing — Favorite Hearts"} description={"Pricing at Favorite Hearts. Clear information for thoughtful matrimony introductions and support."} headline={"Find your person. Choose your beginning."} />
</head>
<body class="tw-antialiased">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<Header />
<Navigation />
<main id="main" class="resource-page" data-theme="light">
<section class="section resource-intro">
<p class="label">Pricing</p>
<h1>Find your person.<br>Choose your beginning.</h1>
<p class="resource-lead">Explore plans for Sri Lanka and the Sri Lankan diaspora. Choose your package during account creation—not on this page.</p>
</section>
<section class="section plans-section" aria-labelledby="plans-title">
<p class="label">Find your starting point</p>
<h2 id="plans-title">Three ways to begin.</h2>
<div class="currency-control">
<span id="currency-local">Sri Lankan LKR</span>
<label class="currency-switch">
<input type="checkbox" id="currency-toggle" role="switch" aria-label="Use Overseas USD">
<span class="currency-switch-track" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</label>
<span id="currency-overseas">Overseas USD</span>
</div>
<p class="market-description" id="market-description">For members based in Sri Lanka. Prices shown in LKR.</p>
<div class="pricing-carousel tw-min-w-0" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Subscription plans">
<div class="plans-grid pricing-track" tabindex="0" aria-label="Subscription plans — use left and right arrow keys to browse">
<article class="plan-card" aria-label="Essential plan">
<div class="plan-topline">
<p class="label">Favorite Hearts</p>
<span class="plan-icon" aria-hidden="true">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M12 20S3 14.5 3 8.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 9-1 4.5 4.5 0 0 1 9 1C21 14.5 12 20 12 20Z"/>
</svg>
</span>
</div>
<h3>Essential</h3>
<p class="plan-tagline">A thoughtful first step.</p>
<p class="plan-price">
<span class="plan-currency">LKR</span> <span data-price-local="3,000" data-price-diaspora="29">3,000</span>
</p>
<p class="plan-period">Plan duration to be confirmed</p>
<ul>
<li>Matrimonial profile</li>
<li>Browse and express interest</li>
<li>Private details after mutual acceptance</li>
<li>Standard support</li>
</ul>
<p class="plan-selection">Choose during account creation</p>
</article>
<article class="plan-card" aria-label="Signature plan">
<div class="plan-topline">
<p class="label">Favorite Hearts</p>
<span class="plan-icon" aria-hidden="true">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="m12 2 2.6 6.8L22 12l-7.4 3.2L12 22l-2.6-6.8L2 12l7.4-3.2Z"/>
</svg>
</span>
</div>
<h3>Signature</h3>
<p class="plan-tagline">A little more guidance.</p>
<p class="plan-price">
<span class="plan-currency">LKR</span> <span data-price-local="5,000" data-price-diaspora="49">5,000</span>
</p>
<p class="plan-period">Plan duration to be confirmed</p>
<ul>
<li>Everything in Essential</li>
<li>Profile presentation guidance</li>
<li>Help reviewing your introduction</li>
<li>Priority support — proposed</li>
</ul>
<p class="plan-selection">Choose during account creation</p>
</article>
<article class="plan-card" aria-label="Premier plan">
<div class="plan-topline">
<p class="label">Favorite Hearts</p>
<span class="plan-icon" aria-hidden="true">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="m3 7 5 4 4-7 4 7 5-4-2 12H5Z"/>
<path d="M6 22h12"/>
</svg>
</span>
</div>
<h3>Premier</h3>
<p class="plan-tagline">Support for your next chapter.</p>
<p class="plan-price">
<span class="plan-currency">LKR</span> <span data-price-local="8,000" data-price-diaspora="69">8,000</span>
</p>
<p class="plan-period">Plan duration to be confirmed</p>
<ul>
<li>Everything in Signature</li>
<li>Dedicated onboarding guidance — proposed</li>
<li>Family-managed profile setup guidance</li>
<li>Personal profile review — proposed</li>
</ul>
<p class="plan-selection">Choose during account creation</p>
</article>
</div>
<div class="pricing-dashes" aria-label="Subscription plans navigation">
<button type="button" aria-label="Go to subscription plans 1" aria-current="true">
<span aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</button>
<button type="button" aria-label="Go to subscription plans 2" aria-current="false">
<span aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</button>
<button type="button" aria-label="Go to subscription plans 3" aria-current="false">
<span aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<p class="plan-template-note">Package templates: prices are shown as provided; plan durations and proposed service benefits are not final. Full inclusions and terms will be shown during account creation before you select or pay for a package. This page does not collect payments.</p>
</section>
<section class="section resource-band" data-theme="dark">
<p class="label">The planned payment journey</p>
<h2>Simple steps.<br>A clear decision.</h2>
<div class="pricing-carousel tw-min-w-0" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Membership steps">
<div class="resource-grid pricing-track" tabindex="0" aria-label="Membership steps — use left and right arrow keys to browse">
<article class="resource-card">
<svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
<rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/>
<path d="m8 9 2 2 5-5M8 16h8"/>
</svg>
<span class="resource-index">Step 01</span>
<h3>Choose your plan</h3>
<p>Review the published price, period, features, and terms before deciding.</p>
</article>
<article class="resource-card">
<svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M12 16V3m-5 5 5-5 5 5M4 14v6h16v-6"/>
</svg>
<span class="resource-index">Step 02</span>
<h3>Submit payment proof</h3>
<p>When payments open, follow the official bank-transfer instructions and submit proof through the designated process.</p>
</article>
<article class="resource-card">
<svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/>
<path d="m7 12 3 3 7-7"/>
</svg>
<span class="resource-index">Step 03</span>
<h3>Wait for approval</h3>
<p>The planned subscription activates after payment verification. Sending a slip alone does not activate membership.</p>
</article>
</div>
<div class="pricing-dashes" aria-label="Membership steps navigation">
<button type="button" aria-label="Go to membership steps 1" aria-current="true">
<span aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</button>
<button type="button" aria-label="Go to membership steps 2" aria-current="false">
<span aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</button>
<button type="button" aria-label="Go to membership steps 3" aria-current="false">
<span aria-hidden="true">
</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<p class="band-small">Payments are not open on this website. Do not transfer money based only on a social message or a description of planned features.</p>
</section>
<section class="section resource-section">
<p class="label">Membership questions</p>
<h2>The details matter.</h2>
<div class="resource-questions">
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>Can I pay or subscribe now?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>No. This website does not collect payments or activate subscriptions. Contact our team for current information before making any payment.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>Do men and women both need a paid account?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>Yes, the planned matrimony model requires a paid subscription to publish a profile for both men and women. Local plan prices are LKR 3,000, 5,000, and 8,000. Diaspora plan prices are USD 29, 49, and 69. Final durations and inclusions will be shown before payment.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>Can a parent pay for a profile?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>The planned experience supports authorised family-managed profiles. The person making a payment should understand which candidate and plan it relates to. Payment does not replace the candidate’s own wishes or grant unrestricted access to their information.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>Will a subscription renew automatically?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>Renewal arrangements have not been published. Do not assume automatic renewal. The final subscription terms must explain how renewal works before you subscribe.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>What is the cancellation or refund policy?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>Final cancellation and refund conditions have not been published. These need to be available before a paid service is offered. Contact the team about any payment concern; nothing on this page removes applicable consumer rights.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>Does membership include chat or horoscope matching?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>In the planned matrimony experience, contact details are shared after mutual acceptance rather than through in-app chat. Horoscope matching is reserved for a later version and is not currently available.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details name="resource-answer">
<summary>How do I ask about a payment I have already made?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
</summary>
<div>
<p>Contact support with the payment reference and a short description. Do not share passwords, one-time codes, or full bank statements. The team can help clarify the payment and the appropriate next step.</p>
</div>
</details>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section resource-end" data-theme="dark">
<div>
<p class="label">Let’s make it clear</p>
<h2>Still weighing<br>things up?</h2>
<p>Ask us about membership, payments, or what is planned for Favorite Hearts.</p>
</div>
<div class="resource-actions">
<a class="pill" href="/help/">Explore Help &amp; FAQ <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
<a class="pill" href="/contact/">Contact us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
<p class="response-hours">Daily, 8:00 AM–10:00 PM<br>Sri Lanka time</p>
</div>
</section>
</main><Footer />
<Dialogs />
</body>
</html>
